OL,3,GNEWSASnapchat predator jailed for child
OL,4,Asex offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "high-risk" child sex predator who
OL,7,Ftargeted young girls online has been
OL,8,Fjailed for more than seven years after
OL,9,Fhe admitted to more than 40 child
OL,10,Foffences.
OL,12,FKasey Fitton, 20, of no fixed abode,
OL,13,Fwas described as a dangerous
OL,14,F"manipulative groomer" by Judge Sophie
OL,15,FMcKone at Bradford Crown Court on
OL,16,FMonday, where he plead guilty to a
OL,17,Fcatalogue of offences committed between
OL,18,FMay 2024 and August 2025.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
