OL,3,GNEWSASnapchat predator jailed for child
OL,4,Asex offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement read to court, a mother
OL,7,Fof one victim said Fitton was a
OL,8,F"predator" who preyed on "vulnerability
OL,9,Fand innocence".
OL,11,FAfter sentencing, police said
OL,12,Finvestigations continued and urged
OL,13,Fanyone who had interacted with Snapchat
OL,14,Faccounts Kaseyfitton23, Kaseyfitton24
OL,15,Fand MyCroft110 to come forward.
